Recommends: homelab-database, homelab-pgbouncer
Description: Identity/auth/RBAC and service registry for the homelab-* ecosystem
 A Mojolicious app providing account registration/login, JWT
 issuance/introspection/refresh (rotating refresh tokens, Argon2id
 password hashing), minimal role-based access control, and the
 cross-feature service registry (POST/GET /api/v1/registry/...) that
 every other homelab-* feature's Homelab::Common::Registry client talks
 to. Owns its own `api` Postgres schema via the split runtime/migrate
 role design (see CLAUDE.md) -- postinst bootstraps both roles via
 homelab-bootstrap-app-role, registers the runtime role with pgbouncer,
 and applies its own schema migrations on every install/upgrade.
